%h3 Hi Action.IO Admin,

Please investigate why these boxes are dangling, help to fix/destroy the box and apologize to the owner, thanks!

Yours sincerely,
The Dangle Bot

%table
  %tr
    %th ID
    %th Name
    %th State
    %th Region
    %th Owner's Email
    %th Created At (UTC)

  - @dangling_boxes.each do |box|
    %tr
      %td= box.id
      %td= box.name
      %td= box.state
      %td= box.region.name
      %td= box.owner.email
      %td= box.created_at.strftime('%m-%e-%y %H:%M')

